      "versionNonce": 602573518,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793082440137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1 (Audit & Strategy): Pata chala ki audit tools me scores theek the lekin\n0 backlinks, 37-word homepage, aur 1.11s redirect chain ki wajah se actual organic\ngrowth ruki hui thi[cite: 4]. Isme \"ai hook generator\" aur \"types of hooks\" jaise\nlow-competition high-intent keywords target kiye gaye hain[cite: 4].",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1 (Audit & Strategy): Pata chala ki audit tools me scores theek the lekin 0 backlinks, 37-word homepage, aur 1.11s redirect chain ki wajah se actual organic growth ruki hui thi[cite: 4]. Isme \"ai hook generator\" aur \"types of hooks\" jaise low-competition high-intent keywords target kiye gaye hain[cite: 4].",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
