      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793082440137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 2 (AIO & AI Visibility): ChatGPT, Claude, aur Perplexity jaise AI Answer\nEngines mein brand visibility badhane ke liye /llms.txt aur proper entity schemas\n(Organization, SoftwareApplication) setup kiye gaye hain[cite: 4].",
