      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 2 (AIO & AI Visibility): ChatGPT, Claude, aur Perplexity jaise AI Answer Engines mein brand visibility badhane ke liye /llms.txt aur proper entity schemas (Organization, SoftwareApplication) setup kiye gaye hain[cite: 4].",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
