      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793082440138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 3 (Content & Clustering): Pillar-Cluster architecture ke zariye Google aur\nLLMs ko topical authority dikhayi gayi hai, jisme free tool pages (/tools/hook-\ngenerator) natural backlink generate karte hain[cite: 4].",
